looooo/SMESH patch/SMESH_occt781.patch: OCCT 7.8.1 API deltas in SMESH core.
Re-ported to SALOME SMESH V9_16_0 by pySMESH. Two of the original 12 file sections
remain: DriverGMF.cxx (boost::filesystem::extension is gone from Boost) and
SMESHDS_DataMapOfShape.hxx (::HashCode(TopoDS_Shape, int) is gone from OCCT 8).
V9_16_0 carries the other hasher ports itself, under OCC_VERSION_LARGE >= 0x07080000:
SMESH_Controls.cxx, SMESH_FreeBorders.cxx, SMESH_MeshAlgos.cxx, SMESH_Offset.cxx,
SMESH_TypeDefs.hxx (SMESH_TLinkHasher), SMESH_MeshEditor.cxx (ComparableElementHasher),
DriverSTL_R_SMDS_Mesh.cxx (Hasher), and StdMeshers_Quadrangle_2D.cxx no longer includes
NCollection_DefineArray2.hxx. The CMakeLists.txt and MeshVSLink sections are dropped:
pySMESH stages neither file.

diff --git a/src/DriverGMF/DriverGMF.cxx b/src/DriverGMF/DriverGMF.cxx
index bec234d..cba15f6 100644
--- a/src/DriverGMF/DriverGMF.cxx
+++ b/src/DriverGMF/DriverGMF.cxx
@@ -55,7 +55,7 @@ namespace DriverGMF
 
   bool isExtensionCorrect( const std::string& fileName )
   {
-    std::string ext  = boost::filesystem::extension(fileName);
+    std::string ext = boost::filesystem::path(fileName).extension().string();
     switch ( ext.size() ) {
     case 5: return ( ext == ".mesh" || ext == ".solb" );
     case 6: return ( ext == ".meshb" );
diff --git a/src/SMESHDS/SMESHDS_DataMapOfShape.hxx b/src/SMESHDS/SMESHDS_DataMapOfShape.hxx
index 4d751f6..19adbfa 100644
--- a/src/SMESHDS/SMESHDS_DataMapOfShape.hxx
+++ b/src/SMESHDS/SMESHDS_DataMapOfShape.hxx
@@ -42,7 +42,15 @@ struct SMESHDS_Hasher
   static inline Standard_Integer HashCode(const TopoDS_Shape& S,
                                           const Standard_Integer Upper)
   {
-    return ::HashCode( S, Upper);
+    size_t hash_value = std::hash<TopoDS_Shape>{}(S);
+    return hash_value % Upper;
+  }
+
+  size_t operator()(const TopoDS_Shape& S) const noexcept {
+    return std::hash<TopoDS_Shape>{}(S);
+  }
+  size_t operator()(const TopoDS_Shape& S1, const TopoDS_Shape& S2) const noexcept {
+    return S1.IsSame(S2);
   }
 };
 
